====================================
if u want to run the Application 
The backend can be started from the project root directory:

enter:   python3 backend/main.py. 

====================================

Running All Tests:

From the project root directory:

enter:   python3 -m pytest
=====================================


Testing Techniques Applied
The following testing techniques were applied in accordance with the assignment requirements:

Black-Box Testing.         python3 -m pytest tests/wcvt1/test/blackbox/ -v
Boundary Value Analysis
Equivalence Partitioning
Random Testing

White-Box Testing.         python3 -m pytest tests/wcvt1/test/whitebox/ -v
Statement Coverage
Branch Coverage
concolic

Research Component
